---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const locale = 'de';
const pageTitle = 'Kontakt';
const pageDescription = 'Kontaktieren Sie yoimagine Tools. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne bei Fragen, Feedback und Partnerschaftsanfragen.';
---

<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} locale={locale}>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <header class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Kontakt</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Haben Sie eine Frage, Feedback oder eine Geschäftsanfrage? Wir freuen uns, von Ihnen zu hören. Wir antworten in der Regel innerhalb von 48 Stunden.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 text-center">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">E-Mail</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">support@yoimagine.com</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">Thema</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">PDF-, SEO- &amp; Karriere-Tools</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-violet-100 text-violet-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">Antwortzeit</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Innerhalb von 48 Stunden</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 text-center leading-relaxed">
          Geben Sie bei Fehlerberichten den Namen des Tools und so viele Details wie möglich zum Problem an, damit wir es schnell beheben können. Danke, dass Sie uns helfen, yoimagine Tools zu verbessern.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>